{"active_object_question_id": "", "active_object_ref": {}, "answer_authority_source": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "tutorbot", "conversation_id": "tb_1fefee8850a84ed8be62d908", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_r4_new_risk", "event_count": 118, "event_source": "tutorbot", "execution_engine": "tutorbot_runtime", "execution_path": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "", "question_id": "", "question_lifecycle_decision": {"business_gate_result": "passed", "decision_source": "deterministic", "exact_question_blocked_reason": "", "llm_scene_candidate": null, "needs_clarification": false, "reason": "deterministic lifecycle scene matched", "required_anchor_status": "satisfied", "scene": "mcq_grading", "scene_confidence": 1.0, "selected_skill_names": ["construction-exam-tutor", "construction-mcq-grading"]}, "response_excerpt": "## 结论\n\n**正确，选 A。**\n\n**判断依据：** 供电系统分为强电系统和弱电系统。强电系统包括供电、照明；弱电系统包括通信、信息、探测、报警。照明属于强电系统。\n\n**采分点：** 设备体系 → 供电系统 → 强电系统（供电、照明）。\n\n**易错点：** 容易把照明和弱电系统（通信、报警）混在一起。记住一个分界线：**照明和供电是强电，通信和报警是弱电。**", "result_mode": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "result_seq": 116, "round_id": "QA30-R4-001", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "tb_1fefee8850a84ed8be62d908", "object_type": "open_chat_topic", "source_turn_id": "turn_1780717634096_e42bf7e0f7", "version": 2}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "open_world_teaching", "turn_id": "turn_1780717624130_3a96476ed4", "turn_semantic_decision": {}, "turn_status": "completed"}
{"active_object_question_id": "", "active_object_ref": {}, "answer_authority_source": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "assistant_content_source": "", "capability": "tutorbot", "conversation_id": "tb_1fefee8850a84ed8be62d908", "correct_answer_present": false, "entry_surface": "near_real_http_ws_r4_new_risk", "event_count": 88, "event_source": "tutorbot", "execution_engine": "tutorbot_runtime", "execution_path": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "is_correct": "", "learner_answer": "", "missing_trace_fields": [], "official_answer": "", "options_hash": "", "question_hash": "", "question_id": "", "question_lifecycle_decision": {"business_gate_result": "no_candidate", "decision_source": "none", "exact_question_blocked_reason": "", "llm_scene_candidate": null, "needs_clarification": false, "reason": "no deterministic scene and LLM proposal not applicable", "required_anchor_status": "", "scene": null, "scene_confidence": 0.0, "selected_skill_names": []}, "response_excerpt": "## 结论\n\n照明不是弱电系统。\n\n## 判断依据\n\n弱电系统处理的是**信息传输与信号控制**（通信、信息、探测、报警），而照明需要**传输电能来驱动灯具发光**，属于电力负荷，归入强电系统。\n\n**一句话记：** 弱电传**信号**，强电传**电力**。照明要通电才能亮，所以是强电。", "result_mode": "tutorbot_kb_first_fast_policy", "result_seq": 86, "round_id": "QA30-R4-002", "session_active_object_ref": {"object_id": "tb_1fefee8850a84ed8be62d908", "object_type": "open_chat_topic", "source_turn_id": "turn_1780717634096_e42bf7e0f7", "version": 2}, "terminal_status": "completed", "trace_complete": true, "trace_expectation": "open_world_teaching", "turn_id": "turn_1780717634096_e42bf7e0f7", "turn_semantic_decision": {}, "turn_status": "completed"}
